# Design taste (agent-time)

When editing **landing, portfolio, or visual-led** UI:

1. Read **Hallmark** (`.cursor/skills/hallmark/SKILL.md`) and run the matching verb (default build, or audit/redesign/study).
2. Read **Taste** (`.cursor/skills/design-taste-frontend/SKILL.md`).
3. Use **Impeccable** Persuade or Experience mode (this site is not Operate CRM chrome).
4. Keep feedback short. Honor existing tokens, bilingual copy, and privacy-gate behaviour.

This is not a CI gate. Do not enable Impeccable edit hooks.
